      "snippet": {
        "text": "The level of preparedness of the teachers interviewed was generally high in terms of generative AI. The results showed that collaborative ranked first, problem solving ranked second, critical thinking ranked third, creativity ranked fourth, and algorithmic thinking was perceived to rank last among the five indicators of generative AI. \n\nThe relatively high level of preparedness among the teachers' responses is a good indicator of the successful and positive use of generative AI in education. This suggests that teachers are eager to embrace innovation, adapt to technological advances, and utilize AI for superior learning experiences with a student-centered approach. (See Table 2",
