rs have given students ChatGPT projects.\n\nChatGPT can summarize, solve math problems, explain terms and abstract concepts and theories, write and fix computer codes, and write various texts, including poems, stories, or novels, and more (Azaria, 2022;Mintz, 2023).It can respond to follow-up queries, admit mistakes, and reject inappropriate requests (OpenAI, 2023).",
