      "snippet": {
        "text": "This study finds that ChatGPT-4 demonstrates considerable promise as a valuable instrument for enhancing students' proficiency in English communication, mitigating linguistic inaccuracies, and cultivating favorable reception and attitudes among students. To fully reap the benefits, a well-thought-out integration strategy that considers the unique needs of each student in English communication and the specific goals of the school as a whole, must be developed. Continuous evaluation and tweaking are required to maintain effectiveness over time. Governments need to consider AI systems such as ChatGPT-4 and ways to facilitate the incorporation of new technologies into existing language education curricula. One possible direction for investigation is the provision of resources for the study, design, and introduction of AI-driven language learning aids, such as ChatGPT-4, in English learning. Teachers should incorporate ChatGPT-4 as a supplemental resource to teach English linguistics. Opportunities for professional development can be made available to help teachers successfully incorporate AI tools such as ChatGPT-4 into their classroom practices. The formation of joint ventures between ChatGPT-4 developers and teachers can lead to the creation of individualized instructional materials bolstered by ChatGPT-4.",
