th parents and caregivers. They prompted the AI to revise or review emails related to student progress, absences, safety drills, or behavioral concerns. For instance, one teacher asked the AI to revise a family-facing message about a student's risk of not passing a course, incorporating both concrete action steps and an empathetic tone. Others sought help with questions like: \"How would you report and discuss grades with individual students' caregivers?\" and \"Make it interesting for families and outside audiences.\"",
